    },
    "历史工作目录与项目当前位置不同。请只读查看旧会话，或在当前位置新建会话；不会在旧目录执行。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The historical working directory differs from the current project location. Browse the old session read-only or start a new session in the current location. Pikachu will not run tasks in the old directory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史累计统计包含其他分支与压缩用量；当前上下文占用需连接后查询。费用为美元估算，缺失不计作零。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Historical totals include other branches and compaction. Connect to query current context usage. Costs are estimated in USD. Missing data is not counted as zero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
